{"4089340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BattleLine", "steam_appid": 4089340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEY FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct connection with friends allows for a quick and easy way to prove once and for all whose tactics are superior!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new spin on turn based combat! Instead of reacting to the other players' choices you will need to predict them. You are both taking your turns at the same time, so you will need to anticipate your opponent's move if victory is to be achieved!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 unique characters that are ready for battle. Each has a unique attack, health pool, and special ability that are limited by the amount of actions they can take in a round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score points by holding objectives and eliminating opposing heroes. They are placed in the beginning of the round, and can alter your strategy.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEY FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct connection with friends allows for a quick and easy way to prove once and for all whose tactics are superior!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new spin on turn based combat! Instead of reacting to the other players' choices you will need to predict them. You are both taking your turns at the same time, so you will need to anticipate your opponent's move if victory is to be achieved!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 unique characters that are ready for battle. Each has a unique attack, health pool, and special ability that are limited by the amount of actions they can take in a round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score points by holding objectives and eliminating o